## Complete Workflow Lifecycle

```
[User Request / Target Feature]
            │
            ▼
PHASE 1 — PLAN
1. Discovery & Context Gathering
   ├── Check for Feature Specification / Ticket Files (optional)
   ├── Inspect Frontend UI Components (inputs, buttons, dialogs, tables)
   ├── Check Backend Models & API Contracts (schemas, endpoints, validations)
   └── Inspect Design References / Wireframes (if available)
2. Persona & Journey Definition
   ├── Identify User Roles, Permissions & Feature Flag States
   └── Map End-to-End Business Journeys to Test Suites
3. Test Suite & Step Authoring
   └── [Step # | Action | Selector / Target | Expected Result] tables
4. Compile & Save <FEATURE>_MANUAL_TEST_PLAN.md
            │
            ▼
   ◆ Human review / approval of the plan ◆
            │
            ▼
PHASE 2 — EXECUTE
0. Test Plan Verification (gate)
1. Environment & Service Health Check
2. Automation Script Construction & Execution
   ├── Seed fixtures / accounts
   ├── Run step-by-step automation across all suites
   ├── Sanitize DOM overlays & capture screenshots (cleanAndScreenshot)
   └── Query Backend / DB / Cache to verify downstream persistence
3. Results & Evidence Aggregation (JSON)
4. Executive DOCX Report Compilation
5. Archive Integrity Verification (`unzip -t`)
6. Summary Delivery
```

